<title>USA: Fleet, Conn. set $45 mln urban loan fund.</title>
<headline>Fleet, Conn. set $45 mln urban loan fund.</headline>
<dateline>HARTFORD 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Connecticut Gov John Rowland on Tuesday announced a $45 million loan fund to be led by Fleet Bank targetted for urban projects.</p>
<p>The fund is set up to revitalize poor residential neighborhoods by promoting home ownership and providing affordable housing for low-income state residents.</p>
</text>
